WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Watch the pack.

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.160
One tap.

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.950
Five cards hit the table.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.840
Wait for that last flip.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:09.300
That’s the DEXPit pack opener from Engines of Creation.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.540
We took that moment and gave it a second job: opening a market.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:16.660
Here’s the first real pack on BNB testnet.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.200
Five test dollars.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.190
Crusher. Fighter’s Cry.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.420
Charge. Disengage.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.800
And in the fifth slot?

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.250
Murder. An Epic pull.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.380
That receipt also locks in 76,923 GAME.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.330
Pack order sets the amount.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.600
The last flip is just for the cards.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.480
Skip to pack twelve.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.460
60 test dollars raised.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:43.880
Flap creates GAME and pairs half a million tokens with the entire raise.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.120
The other half funds pack claims.

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:48.300
This buyer already claimed.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:52.180
For our next game, imagine opening a founder’s gear kit.

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:53.380
Different items.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.550
The same stablecoin collection and Flap settlement.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.720
Flap, help Engines of Creation bring this to a second game.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.230
Start with DEXPit.

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:03.490
Open the receipts.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.440
See what one pack can do.
